Ken Owens and Konrad Delong.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.630
And the topic for
the talk today is

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:24.130
about developing
applications on Kubernetes.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.070
So first off, by a
show of hands, who

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:30.610
here has heard of Kubernetes?

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.130
That's good, yeah, because
the word has probably

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.200
been mentioned a few
